+# Blank LSAD normalization implementation plan
+
+## Scope
+
+Implement the design in
+`2026-08-02-blank-lsad-normalization-design.md`.
+
+## Tasks
+
+1. Import the existing `coerce_lsad_code()` utility.
+2. Add a private normalization helper returning `str | None`.
+3. Normalize before LSAD lookup and before the LSAD `27` branch.
+4. Keep unknown nonblank-code rejection unchanged.
+5. Extend unit tests for blank, null-like, list-repr, known, and unknown values.
+
+## Validation
+
+Run:
+
+```bash
+uv run pytest tests/src/init_migration/test_jurisdiction_seed.py
+uv run pytest tests/src/init_migration/test_generate_pipeline_stub_classification.py
+uv run ruff check src/init_migration/jurisdiction_seed.py tests/src/init_migration/test_jurisdiction_seed.py
+```
+
+Then repeat the pinned six-fixture capture after applying patch 1 and patch 2.
+The capture should remain deterministic and should not regress any fix-1
+Jurisdiction paths.
